{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-zec-1-intro","title":"Zechariah 1 — Chapter Introduction","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":0,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":0},"content":"<p>1; 2:1,10,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-1","title":"Zechariah 1:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Zechariah exhorts to repentance. 7 The vision of the horses. 12 At the prayer of the angel comfortable promises are made to Jerusalem. 18 The vision of the four horns and the four carpenters.</p>\n<p>the eighth. 7; 7:1; Ezr 4:24; 6:15; Hag 1:1,15; 2:1,10,20 Zechariah. Ezr 5:1; Mt 23:35; Lu 11:51 Iddo. Ne 12:4,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-2","title":"Zechariah 1:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Lord. 2Ki 22:16,17,19; 23:26; 2Ch 36:13-20; Ezr 9:6,7,13; Ne 9:26,27 Ps 60:1; 79:5,6; Jer 44:6; La 1:12-15; 2:3-5; 3:42-45; 5:7; Eze 22:31 Da 9:11,12; Zep 2:1-3; Mt 23:30-32; Ac 7:52 sore displeased. Heb. with displeasure.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-3","title":"Zechariah 1:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Turn. De 4:30,31; 30:2-10; 1Ki 8:47,48; 2Ch 15:4; 30:6-9; Ne 9:28 Isa 31:6; 55:6,7; Jer 3:12-14,22; 4:1; 25:5; 35:15; La 3:39-41 Eze 33:11; Ho 6:1; 14:1; Joe 2:12; Mal 3:7; Lu 15:18-20; Jas 4:8-10 and Jer 12:15; 29:12-14; 31:18-20; Ho 14:4; Mic 7:19,20; Lu 15:21,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-4","title":"Zechariah 1:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>as. 2Ch 29:6-10; 30:7; 34:21; Ezr 9:7; Ne 9:16; Ps 78:8; 106:6,7 Eze 18:14-17; 1Pe 1:18 unto. 7:11-13; 2Ch 24:19-22; 36:15,16; Ne 9:26,30; Isa 30:9-11 Jer 6:16,17; 13:16-18; 17:19-23; 25:3-7; 35:15; 36:2,3-10; 44:4,5 Eze 3:7-9; Mic 2:6; Ac 7:51,52; 1Th 2:15,16 Turn. 3; Isa 1:16-19; 31:6; Jer 3:12; 7:3-7; 18:11; Eze 18:30-32; 33:11 Ho 14:1; Am 5:13-15,24; Mt 3:8-10; Ac 3:19; 26:20 but. Jer 11:6-8; 13:9,10; 26:5; 36:23,24; 44:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-5","title":"Zechariah 1:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Job 14:10-12; Ps 90:10; Ec 1:4; 9:1-3; 12:5,7; Ac 13:36; Heb 7:23,24 Heb 9:27; 2Pe 3:2-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-6","title":"Zechariah 1:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>my words. Isa 55:1 did. Nu 23:19; 32:23; 2Ch 36:17-21; Isa 44:26; Jer 26:15; 44:28 Eze 12:25-28; Da 9:11,12; Mt 24:35 take hold of. or, overtake. De 28:15,45; Jer 12:16; Am 9:10; 1Th 5:4 they returned. Job 6:29; Mal 3:18 Like. La 1:18; 2:17; 4:11,12; Eze 37:11 thought. Nu 33:56; Jer 23:20 according to our ways. De 28:20; Isa 3:8-11; Jer 4:4; 18:8-11; Eze 20:43; Ho 9:15; 2:6-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-7","title":"Zechariah 1:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>A.M. 3845. B.C. 519. the eleventh. 1 Sebat.{Sebat} is the Chaldee name of the eleventh month of the ecclesiastical year, but the fifth of the civil year, answering to part of January and February.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-8","title":"Zechariah 1:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>by night. Ge 20:3; 1Ki 3:5; Job 4:13; Da 2:19; 7:2,13 behold. 13:7; Jos 5:13; Ps 45:3,4; Isa 63:1-4 riding. 6:2-7; Re 6:4; 19:19-21 among. So 2:16; 6:2; Isa 41:19; 55:13; 57:15; Re 2:1 speckled. or, bay. 6:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-9","title":"Zechariah 1:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>what. 19; 4:4,11; 6:4; Da 7:16; 8:15; Re 7:13,14 the angel. 2:3; 4:5; 5:5; 6:4,5; Ge 31:11; Da 8:16; 9:22,23; 10:11-14 Re 17:1-7; 19:9,10; 22:8-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-10","title":"Zechariah 1:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>the man. 8,11; 13:7; Ge 32:24-31; Ho 12:3-5 These. 11; 4:10; 6:5-8; Job 2:1,2; Ps 103:20,21; Eze 1:5-14; Heb 1:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-11","title":"Zechariah 1:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>they answered. 8,10; Ps 68:17; 103:20,21; Mt 13:41,49; 24:30,31; 25:31; 2Th 1:7 Re 1:1 We. 6:7; Da 10:20 is. 15; 1Th 5:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-12","title":"Zechariah 1:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>the angel. 8,10,11; Ex 23:20-23; Isa 63:9; Heb 7:25 how. Ps 74:10; 69:5; 102:13; Isa 64:9-12; Re 6:10 thou hast. 7:5; 2Ch 36:21; Jer 25:11,12; 29:10; Da 9:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-13","title":"Zechariah 1:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>with good. 14-16; 2:4-12; 8:2-8,19; Isa 40:1,2; Jer 29:10; 30:10-22; 31:3-14 Am 9:11-15; Zep 3:14-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-14","title":"Zechariah 1:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the angel. 9,13; 2:3,4; 4:1 Cry. 17; Isa 40:1,6 I am. 8:2,3; Isa 9:7; 38:22; 42:13; 59:17; 63:15; Ho 11:8; Joe 2:18; Na 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-15","title":"Zechariah 1:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>2,11; Isa 47:7-9; Jer 48:11-13; Am 6:1; Re 18:7,8 for. Isa 54:8; Heb 12:6,7 and. Ps 69:26; 83:2-5; 137:7; Isa 10:5-7; 47:6; Jer 51:24,34,35 Eze 25:3-7,12-17; 26:2; 29:6,7; 25:3-9; 36:4,5; Am 1:3-13; Ob 1:10-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-16","title":"Zechariah 1:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>I am. 2:10,11; 8:3; Isa 12:1; 54:8-10; Jer 31:22-25; 33:10-12 Eze 37:24-28; 39:25-29; 48:35 my house. 4:9; Ezr 6:14,15; Isa 44:26-28; Hag 1:14 and. 2:1,2; Job 38:5; Isa 34:11; Jer 31:39,40; Eze 40:3; 47:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-17","title":"Zechariah 1:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>My cities. Ne 11:3,20; Ps 69:35; Isa 44:26; 61:4-6; Jer 31:23,24; 32:43,44 Jer 33:13; Eze 36:10,11,33; Am 9:14; Ob 1:20 prosperity. Heb. good. the Lord shall. Isa 40:1,2; 49:13; 51:3,12; 52:9; 54:8; 66:13; Jer 31:13; Zep 3:15-17 choose. 2:12; 3:2; 2Ch 6:6; Ps 132:13,14; Isa 14:1; 41:8,9; Ro 11:28,29 Eph 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-18","title":"Zechariah 1:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>lifted. 2:1; 5:1,5,9; Jos 5:13; Da 8:3 four. 2Ki 15:29; 17:1-6; 18:9-12; 24:1-25:30; Da 2:37-43; 7:3-8; 8:3-14 Da 11:28-35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-19","title":"Zechariah 1:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>What. 9,21; 2:2; 4:11-14; Re 7:13,14 scattered. 21; 8:14; Ezr 4:1,4,7; 5:3; Jer 50:17,18; Da 12:7; Hab 3:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-20","title":"Zechariah 1:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>four. 9:12-16; 10:3-5; 12:2-6; De 33:25; Jud 11:16,18; 1Sa 12:11; Ne 9:27 Isa 54:15-17; Ob 1:21; Mic 5:5,6,8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-1-21","title":"Zechariah 1:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>These are the. 19; Da 12:7 fray.That is, to terrify, or affright, from the French {effrayer.}</p>\n<p>which. Ps 75:4,5; La 2:17</p>"}]}